### `SYN-013`: AI Pathfinding Disruption, LAW-001 & Dual-Channel Tactile Invariant

* **Target Subsystems:** `UAshenScenario2MissionSubsystem`, `UAshenPathfindingDisruptionEvaluatorComponent`, `UUAshenStateTreeTask_GarrettDeployTrap`, `UAshenScenario2HapticBridge`
* **Related Specifications:** [`SCENARIO-SPEC-069`](file:///c:/Users/Chris/Ashen%20Oath%20Unreal%20Engine/Docs/SCENARIO-SPEC-069%20%28SCENARIO%202%20%E2%80%94%20THE%20SENTINEL%27S%20GAMBIT%29.md), `Ashen Oath_ Vertical Slice Scenario Reference Guide.md`

#### 📐 Mathematical Invariants:
$$\text{Utility}_{\text{nav}}(N) = \text{clamp}(\text{BaseUtility} - 0.25 \cdot N_{\text{traps}}, 0.0, 1.0)$$
$$\text{CircuitBreakerState} = \begin{cases} \text{Tripped (Failed Recovery)}, & \text{if } \text{Utility}_{\text{nav}} < 0.15 \\ \text{Degraded Routing}, & \text{if } 0.15 \le \text{Utility}_{\text{nav}} < 0.70 \\ \text{Normal Navigation}, & \text{if } \text{Utility}_{\text{nav}} \ge 0.70 \end{cases}$$
