$$H_{\text{right}} = \begin{cases} 0.90, & \text{Phosphor Flare Active} \\ 0.05, & \text{Resting White Flame Spark} \end{cases}$$

#### 💡 Architectural Insight & Impact:
* **The Architect of Chaos:** Garrett's gameplay does not rely on brute force. By placing traps at choke points, players intentionally degrade enemy pathfinding utility until the LAW-001 Circuit Breaker trips, causing panicked enemies to plunge off ravine ledges.
* **Dual-Channel Somatic Immersion:** Splitting motor feedback—low rumble in the left hand (ambient Corruption) and sharp high sparks in the right (White Flame)—creates tactile spatialization during stealth vault infiltrations.

